    <rdfs:label xml:lang="en">original type</rdfs:label>
    <rdfs:comment xml:lang="en">The resource type exactly as received from the source provider, before normalization to the Content Type controlled vocabulary (e.g. 'journalArticle'). The normalized value is expressed via triple:hasContentType.</rdfs:comment>
